Package: likingInitiative
Title: Access the Liking Rating Database
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Kianté", "Fernandez", email = "kiantefernan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Download and work with the Liking Rating Database, a curated
    collection of subjective liking ratings from published decision-making
    studies. Data is read from versioned release files and cached locally, so
    a pinned version returns the same rows regardless of when it is run.
    Provides access by dataset, by item across studies, or as the whole
    corpus, together with the metadata and citations needed to report it.
